  "CI 42090":                                  { role: "Non classifié", description: "CI 42090 or Blue 1 is a super common synthetic colorant in beauty & food. Used alone, it adds a brilliantsmurf-like blue color, combined withTartrazine, it gives the fifty shades of green." },
