  "CITRUS UNSHIU EXTRACT":                     { role: "Non classifié", description: "The extract coming from the Satsuma Mandarin, an easy to peel, seedless citrus from Japan. Mainly the peel extract is used in cosmetics for itsskin-brightening and antioxidantabilities. We have some more details atCitrus Unshiu Peel Extract >>" },
