  "DIPEPTIDE DIAMINOBUTYROYL BENZYLAMIDE DIACETATE": { role: "Non classifié", description: "This awfully long named ingredient is, in fact, a pretty small molecule. It's atripeptide(a three amino acid peptide) with molecular weight less than 500 Da, meaning that it's small enough to penetrate nicely and easily into the skin." },
