  "LAURYL METHACRYLATE SODIUM METHACRYLATE CROSSPOLYMER": { role: "Non classifié", description: "A synthetic copolymer (big molecule from repeated subunits) that is used as aslip and surface modifier. It is claimed to give sunscreen formulas long-lasting, lightweight and non-sticky properties." },
