  "PADINA PAVONICA THALLUS EXTRACT":           { role: "Non classifié", description: "A naturalextractcomingfrom a brown algaliving in the Mediterranean. It'sclaimedto be ananti-pollution activeingredient that acts as a protective screen against environmental pollution." },
  "PALMITOYL DECAPEPTIDE 21":                  { role: "Non classifié", description: "A peptide that is part of an active peptide complex called \"Renaissance\". It is supposed to increase skin compactness and firmness." },
