  "RETINYL PALMITATE":                         { role: "Non classifié", description: "It's anester form of vitamin A(retinol + palmitic acid) thatbelongs to the \"retinoid family\". The retinoid family is pretty much the royal family of skincare, with the king being the FDA-approved anti-aging ingredienttretinoin.Retinolis also a very famous member of the family,..." },
