  "SYNTACKS":                                  { role: "Non classifié", description: "The trade name for a peptide complex that isclaimedto \"boost the dermal-epidermal junction\" (DEJ) and thus result in firmer and younger looking skin." },
  "TALC":                                      { role: "Non classifié", description: "Talc is themajor component of most powder makeup products(think face powder, eyeshadows, and blushers) that usually contain it up to 70%. Its two winning properties that make it very suitable for this role is itsoutstanding spreadabilityfor a smooth application and itslow cove..." },
  "TARAXACUM OFFICINALE LEAF EXTRACT":         { role: "Non classifié", description: "The extract coming from the leaves of dandelion. It's a folkloric medicine for the treatment of liver and kidney disorders and we could find several studies confirming itsliver-protecting, \"detoxifying\" effect." },
  "TEPRENONE":                                 { role: "Non classifié", description: "An anti-aging active ingredient that'sclaimed by its manufacturertofight \"all signs of aging\" from dehydration, damaged skin barrier, and redness to age spots, wrinkles, and even pores. It works by telomere (the protecting end part of the chromosomes that get shorter during ch..." },
  "TETRADECYL AMINOBUTYROYLVALYLAMINOBUTYRIC UREA TRIFLUOROACETATE": { role: "Non classifié", description: "A small,three amino acid synthetic tripeptidewith a molecular weight smaller than 500 Da (500 Da is often referred to as thelimit for proper skin penetration)." },
