  "TRETINOIN":                                 { role: "Non classifié", description: "If you wanna get the best possible anti-aging (and a bunch of other) effects from your skincare products, tretinoin (or one of the other form of retinoids) has to be in your skincare routine.Tretinoin works!It'sprovenand it's thegold standard in anti-aging technology. It's the..." },
  "TRIETHOXYCAPRYLYLSILANE":                   { role: "Non classifié", description: "A clear, light yellow liquid that isused to coat pigments(such asinorganic sunscreen agentsor colorants) in cosmetic products. The coating helps to stabilize pigments in the formulas and also helps them to spread easily and evenly on the skin." },
  "TRIETHOXYSILYLETHYL POLYDIMETHYLSILOXYETHYL HEXYL DIMETHICONE": { role: "Non classifié", description: "Asilicone fluidused mainly to treatinsoluble powders(such as mineral sunscreen agents or pigments) so that they are easily and evenlydispersableboth in the formula and on the skin." },
  "TRIFLUOROACETYL TRIPEPTIDE 2":              { role: "Non classifié", description: "A3 amino-acid peptidethat works by inhibiting the production of progerin, a cell-aging accelerator protein. The manufacturerclaimsthat Trifluoroacetyl Tripeptide-2 can bring back cell activity to a 20-year-old young cell level and the ingredient can nicelyincrease skin elastic..." },
  "TRIPEPTIDE 29":                             { role: "Non classifié", description: "A small,three-amino acid peptide(Glycine-Proline-Hydroxyproline)found naturally in our collagen structure." },
  "TRIPEPTIDE-1":                              { role: "Non classifié", description: "A small, three amino acid (glycine-histidine-lysine or GHK) peptide that is famous for being atype I collagen fragment. The theory behind collagen-fragment peptides is that when collagen naturally breaks down in the skin, the resulting peptide fragments signal to the skin that..." },
  "TRISILOXANE":                               { role: "Non classifié", description: "A clear, colorless, very easily spreadable and veryvolatile(evaporates from the skin easily)silicone fluid. It leaves a non-greasy, dry-smooth feel on the skin." },
  "TRITICUM VULGARE GERM EXTRACT":             { role: "Non classifié", description: "It's a plant extract that comes from wheat germ. Used asskin- and hair conditioner and skin protectant." },
  "VINEGAR":                                   { role: "Non classifié", description: "The thing that you put on your salad with some olive oil. But in a more scientific sense vinegar is usually a 5% solution of acetic acid. It's used in cosmetic products toadjust pH. Larg amounts of vinegar on the skin could be irritating and drying." },
